  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'electr onic'、'transmit ted'、'Syste m'、'regu lations' – 这些拼写错误使文本难以阅读和理解，降低了可理解性。",
    "A": "证据片段：'as appropriate' – 这个短语没有明确指定何时或什么条件下传输报告，引入歧义。",
    "C": "证据片段：'in order to comply with the applicable fishing regulations' – 假设需求内容正确，但未提供具体法规引用，可能影响正确性验证。",
    "V": "证据片段：'required to be transmitted ... in order to comply' – 没有指定验证传输的方法或标准，如时间限制或确认机制，难以测试是否满足需求。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "All electronic reports from UK fishing vessels are required to be transmitted to the Electronic Recording and Reporting System (ERS) of the UK fisheries administrations as appropriate in order to comply with the applicable fishing regulations.",
    "A": "All electronic reports from UK fishing vessels must be transmitted to ERS upon generation or as specified by the UK fisheries administrations.",
    "C": "保持不变，但建议添加具体法规引用以增强正确性。",
    "V": "All electronic reports must be transmitted to ERS within 24 hours of creation, and a transmission confirmation log must be maintained for verification."
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "U",
      "evidence": "electr onic, transmit ted, Syste m, regu lations",
      "rewrite": "electronic, transmitted, System, regulations"
    },
